        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLOW</strong> is a chill drift experience where style and rhythm take center stage, leaving pure speed in the rearview. Glide through scenic tracks, carve out smooth, satisfying slides, and get lost in the seamless rhythm of the road. In FLOW, it’s not about breaking records - it’s about savoring every moment behind the wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/f2edd2abfcc9396db1e5d63748380ba3.avif?t=1761040292\" alt=\"Scenery with a car\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras_big/f2edd2abfcc9396db1e5d63748380ba3.avif?t=1761040292 width=1600 height=742 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/8d102f432d592e9593588df2d01cc1fa.avif?t=1761040292\" alt=\"MASTER THE ART OF DRIFT\" width=1234 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level unfolds in two unique phases:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead the Way</strong> - You set your own line through every turn while an AI driver follows your path. This is your moment to drive with freedom, creativity, and flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase the Flow</strong> - Switch roles and follow the AI as it carves its ideal line. Match its drifts with precision and rhythm to unlock the perfect flow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/dffe0b8399a5c359e24903c43d845a7f.poster.avif?t=1761040292\" aria-label=\"LEAD GAMEPLAY\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/dffe0b8399a5c359e24903c43d845a7f.webm?t=1761040292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/dffe0b8399a5c359e24903c43d845a7f.mp4?t=1761040292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/a83ad8658501ad75397c0e2d897cec23.avif?t=1761040292\" alt=\"BUILD YOUR RIDE\" width=1234 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a single car and drift your way to new tracks and rewards. Unlock a growing roster of vehicles, each with its own unique personality and handling quirks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make each car your own by swapping parts and adding personal touches - from body kits and rims to paint jobs and more. Your garage is a relaxing space to upgrade and express your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/40ffe85b5845de47a8c433ce00a3629d.poster.avif?t=1761040292\" aria-label=\"CUSTOMIZATION\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/40ffe85b5845de47a8c433ce00a3629d.webm?t=1761040292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/40ffe85b5845de47a8c433ce00a3629d.mp4?t=1761040292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/721b04a8baf01be0407641eebe9558e0.avif?t=1761040292\" alt=\"CAPTURE THE MOMENT\" width=1234 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Photo Mode, you can pause the action at any time to frame the perfect shot. Snap dynamic drift shots, scenic backdrops, or showcase your customized ride in cinematic angles. Whether you are mid-slide on a mountain pass or parked under sunset skies, every moment in FLOW is picture-perfect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/2dfca7cd092e8080ffa3bf85783313ac.poster.avif?t=1761040292\" aria-label=\"PHOTO MODE\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/2dfca7cd092e8080ffa3bf85783313ac.webm?t=1761040292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/2dfca7cd092e8080ffa3bf85783313ac.mp4?t=1761040292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/2d27a5e63708f91f7c5b3c6588acbaec.avif?t=1761040292\" alt=\"WHAT&#039;S COOL ABOUT FLOW\" width=1234 height=107 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead, Then Follow</strong> - Start each run setting the pace, then flip perspectives to chase the AI’s perfect flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flow-Friendly Handling</strong> - Drift physics designed for control, rhythm, and challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo Mode</strong> - Capture your favorite moments, perfect drifts, and scenic views in stunning detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress at Your Own Pace</strong> - Explore scenic routes and drift whenever inspiration strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles with Character</strong> - A diverse collection of cars, each bringing something new to the drift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized Style</strong> - Tune and tweak your rides with a focused set of customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Garage to Call Home</strong> - Relax, upgrade, and make every car truly yours. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras/98b1122c6613e5c4b8adf183506628e0.avif?t=1761040292\" alt=\"Tandem\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895060/extras_big/98b1122c6613e5c4b8adf183506628e0.avif?t=1761040292 width=1600 height=742 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>FLOW</i></strong><i> invites you to slow down, drift deep, and drive with intention. This isn’t racing - it’s a state of mind.</i></p>",
